ess.",thumbnailUrl:$("snow-leopard","scene1.jpg")},{type:"image",name:"Snow Leopard Close-up",model:"Nano Banana Pro",prompt:"An extreme close-up portrait of a snow leopard’s face in its natural alpine habitat. Thick pale fur with dark rosettes, individual hairs sharply visible. Intense pale grey-green eyes with sharp clarity, snowflakes clinging to whiskers and fur. Soft natural alpine light, blurred white snow background. Photorealistic wildlife portrait, ultra-high detail.",thumbnailUrl:$("snow-leopard","scene2.jpg")},{type:"video",name:"Snow Leopard Traversing Ridge",model:"Kling O1",prompt:"A snow leopard walks steadily across a snowy mountain slope, its thick tail trailing behind. Overcast sky, jagged peaks and sparse conifers in the background. Light snowfall, the leopard moves with quiet purpose through deep powder. Wide composition, cinematic wildlife documentary style.",thumbnailUrl:$("snow-leopard","scene3.jpg")}]}]},{id:"dystopian-mutiny",previewUrl:$("dystopian-mutiny","preview.mp4"),previewType:"video",posterUrl:$("dystopian-mutiny","poster.jpg"),aspectRatio:9/14,createdWith:"Image & Video, Voices, Music",assetGroups:[{category:"voices",label:"Voices",assets:[{type:"voice",name:"British Football Announcer",voiceId:"gU0LNdkMOQCOrPrwtbee",prompt:"British Football Announcer narration for dystopian mutiny scene"}]},{category:"music",label:"Music",assets:[{type:"music",name:"Dystopian Trailer Score",prompt:"Dark, dystopian cinematic sci-fi trailer music. Slow bass pulse, deep braams, distant textures, and restrained synth hits. Angst and tension builds with sparse intense hits. Oppressive sci-fi cinematic trailer score."}]},{category:"image-video",label:"Image & Video",assets:[{type:"image",name:"Abandoned Megacity",model:"Nano Banana Pro",prompt:"A vast abandoned megacity canyon at dawn, towering residential blocks rising into turquoise fog. An abandoned car and debris at street level, puddles reflecting faint orange firelight from a distant blaze. Pale sun struggling through pollution. Cinematic, oppressive scale, drifting particles in the air.",thumbnailUrl:$("dystopian-mutiny","scene1.jpg")},{type:"video",name:"Ruined Entrance Approach",model:"Kling O1",prompt:"Camera gently pushes forward toward a ruined concrete building entrance. Peeling walls, rusted metal doors hanging open into darkness. Smoke drifts from the interior. Broken rubble and shallow puddles in the foreground. Very slow, eerie and creepy.",thumbnailUrl:$("dystopian-mutiny","scene2.jpg")},{type:"video",name:"Burning Statue",model:"Kling O1",prompt:"Extreme slow motion. A monumental bronze equestrian statue of a military figure engulfed in roaring flames. Sparks and embers rising into thick black smoke. Surrounding concrete apartment blocks loom on both sides. Wet asphalt reflects intense orange firelight. Very slow zoom, apocalyptic stillness.",thumbnailUrl:$("dystopian-mutiny","scene3.jpg")}]}]},{id:"european-semi-final",previewUrl:$("european-semi-final","preview.mp4"),previewType:"video",posterUrl:$("european-semi-final","poster.jpg"),aspectRatio:16/9,createdWith:"Image & Video, Voices, Music",assetGroups:[{category:"voices",label:"Voices",assets:[{type:"voice",name:"British Football Announcer",voiceId:"gU0LNdkMOQCOrPrwtbee",prompt:"British Football Announcer commentary for European semi-final"}]},{category:"music",label:"Music",assets:[{type:"music",name:"Football Final Anthem",prompt:"Epic ceremonial orchestral anthem for a global football final. Grand, formal, and timeless. Full symphony orchestra with mixed choir singing sustained Latin-style syllables, bold heroic brass, deep strings, timpani, and subtle organ. Slow–mid tempo, beginning quietly and building to a powerful, triumphant climax. Minor key with noble lifts to major. Monumental, dignified, prestigious — history, legacy, elite competition."}]},{category:"image-video",label:"Image & Video",assets:[{type:"image",name:"Stadium Night Aerial",model:"Nano Banana Pro",prompt:"Ultra-cinematic aerial night shot of a legendary European football stadium glowing like a jewel. Sold out, every seat alive with light. Rich emerald green pitch with crisp white lines under powerful floodlights. Sweeping steel arcs and elegant roof structure. Soft gold and cool blue exterior lighting. Fireworks smoke above the roof.",thumbnailUrl:$("european-semi-final","scene1.jpg")},{type:"video",name:"Stadium Orbit",model:"Kling O1",prompt:"Very slow aerial shot orbiting the stadium at night. The camera circles the glowing arena, capturing the scale and energy of a packed European football final. Floodlights illuminate the pitch, fans visible as a sea of moving light.",thumbnailUrl:$("european-semi-final","scene2.jpg")},{type:"video",name:"Match Night Atmosphere",model:"Kling O1",prompt:"Aerial drone shot pulling away from the stadium at night, revealing the full cityscape surrounding it. The stadium radiates golden light, highways glow like veins. Haze in the air catches the floodlights, adding drama and scale to a historic night.",thumbnailUrl:$("european-semi-final","scene3.jpg")}]}]},{id:"tarzan",previewUrl:$("tarzan","preview.mp4"),previewType:"video",posterUrl:$("tarzan","poster.jpg"),aspectRatio:9/16,createdWith:"Image & Video, Voices, Music",assetGroups:[{category:"voices",label:"Voices",assets:[{type:"voice",name:"Jungle Man",voiceId:"",prompt:"Voice generated from video generation"}]},{category:"music",label:"Music",assets:[{type:"music",name:"Jungle Paradise",prompt:"movie background track in the jungle with a jungle man and a gorilla walking together. its peaceful, natural, like african percussions and some flute. like we found paradise in the jungle but still subtle and consistent, no epic stuff no driving energy no rising stuff with a focus on ambient textures and a sense of wonder. add a heavier drum as a beat across the track, still african percussion style"}]},{category:"image-video",label:"Image & Video",assets:[{type:"image",name:"Jungle Lookout",model:"Nano Banana 2",prompt:"A photorealistic shot of a Tarzan-like jungle man and a gorilla peering together through dense tropical foliage. Photographed with ARRI 35mm film camera. Lush green canopy, golden hour light filtering through leaves. They look into the distance, not at the camera. Natural, cinematic.",thumbnailUrl:$("tarzan","scene1.jpg")},{type:"video",name:"Golden Hour Dolly",model:"Kling 3.0",prompt:"Soft ambient jungle sounds, distant bird calls, gentle rustling leaves. Slow, steady dolly in pushing directly forward through dense tropical foliage toward a jungle man and gorilla sitting together at golden hour. The man kneels beside the gorilla with his hand on its shoulder, both gazing forward into the distance.",thumbnailUrl:$("tarzan","scene2.jpg")},{type:"video",name:"Sunset Walk",model:"Kling 3.0",prompt:"Slow steady dolly following a jungle man and gorilla from behind as they walk side by side along a narrow jungle trail toward a distant mountain at sunset. The man’s hand rests on the gorilla’s back in a friendly gesture. Calm, unhurried pace. ARRI 16mm with natural grain, 200mm 2.8 lens.",thumbnailUrl:$("tarzan","scene3.jpg")}]}]},{id:"warrior-showdown",previewUrl:$("warrior-showdown","preview.mp4"),previewType:"video",posterUrl:$("warrior-showdown","poster.jpg"),aspectRatio:16/11,createdWith:"Image & Video, Voices, Music",assetGroups:[{category:"voices",label:"Voices",assets:[{type:"voice",name:"British Football Announcer",voiceId:"gU0LNdkMOQCOrPrwtbee",prompt:"British Football Announcer narration for warrior showdown scene"}]},{category:"music",label:"Music",assets:[{type:"music",name:"Dystopian Trailer Score",prompt:"Dark, dystopian cinematic sci-fi trailer music. Slow bass pulse, deep braams, distant textures, and restrained synth hits. Angst and tension builds with sparse intense hits. Oppressive sci-fi cinematic trailer score."}]},{category:"image-video",label:"Image & Video",assets:[{type:"image",name:"Warriors Standoff",model:"Nano Banana Pro",prompt:"Two warriors facing each other in a dark, cinematic standoff. Dramatic lighting with deep shadows and rim light highlighting their armor and weapons. Dark moody atmosphere, mist and particles in the air. Low angle, epic composition, tense and still before combat.",thumbnailUrl:$("warrior-showdown","scene1.jpg")},{type:"video",name:"Combat Clash",model:"Kling O1",prompt:"Two warriors locked in fierce combat. Dynamic camera movement, weapons clashing with sparks. Dark cinematic lighting, dust and debris in the air. Slow motion impacts intercut with real-time action. Gritty, visceral, intense.",thumbnailUrl:$("warrior-showdown","scene2.jpg")},{type:"video",name:"Aftermath",model:"Kling O1",prompt:"Slow push-in on a warrior standing victorious amid dust and settling debris. Dark atmospheric lighting, heavy breathing visible in cold air. Weapon lowered, the tension finally released. Cinematic stillness after the storm.",thumbnailUrl:$("warrior-showdown","scene3.jpg")}]}]},{id:"vietnamese-soldier",previewUrl:$("vietnamese-soldier","preview.mp4"),previewType:"video",posterUrl:$("vietnamese-soldier","poster.jpg"),aspectRatio:9/13,createdWith:"Image & Video, Music, Sound Effects",assetGroups:[{category:"music",label:"Music",assets:[{type:"music",name:"Jungle Suspense",prompt:"subtle suspense music for a film sequence of a vietnamese soldier during vietnam war in the jungle. he is alone and he is careful and a bit scared so the suspense has to match this. do not include native or natural instrument, it should feel more like scary, a build up for something bad about to happen. in the end of the track there is a riser and a quick climax and release, like the soldier saw a bunny in the bushes, realising that the noises was nothing scary."}]},{category:"sfx",label:"Sound Effects",assets:[{type:"sfx",name:"Jungle Ambience",prompt:"Sound turned on with video generation"}]},{category:"image-video",label:"Image & Video",assets:[{type:"video",name:"Cautious Walk",model:"Kling O3",prompt:"Dense jungle ambience, cicadas, dripping moisture. A Vietnamese soldier moves cautiously forward along a narrow jungle trail, rifle held ready across his chest. Eyes scanning the foliage, sweat-soaked olive uniform. Bamboo and thick ferns pressing in around him, dappled golden light through the canopy.",thumbnailUrl:$("vietnamese-soldier","scene1.jpg")},{type:"video",name:"Face of Fear",model:"Kling O3",prompt:"Silence except for his breathing. Extreme close-up on the soldier’s face, sweat beading on his skin, pores and texture visible. His eyes dart left then right searching the jungle, wide with fear. Jaw clenches, nostrils flare with each rapid shallow breath. Photographed with a camera from the Vietnam War era.",thumbnailUrl:$("vietnamese-soldier","scene2.jpg")},{type:"video",name:"Monkey Surprise",model:"Kling O3",prompt:"Jungle ambience, rustling foliage. The soldier aims his rifle forward into dense bushes, tense and alert — suddenly a monkey leaps from the right side and lands near his shoulder. The soldier recoils with a startled gasp, stumbling slightly. Relief washes over his face.",thumbnailUrl:$("vietnamese-soldier","scene3.jpg")}]}]},{id:"police-squad",previewUrl:$("police-squad","preview.mp4"),previewType:"video",posterUrl:$("police-squad","poster.jpg"),aspectRatio:2,createdWith:"Image & Video, Voices, Music",assetGroups:[{category:"voices",label:"Voices",assets:[{type:"voice",name:"British Football Announcer",voiceId:"gU0LNdkMOQCOrPrwtbee",prompt:"British Football Announcer narration for police squad scene"}]},{category:"music",label:"Music",assets:[{type:"music",name:"Dystopian Trailer Score",prompt:"Dark, dystopian cinematic sci-fi trailer music. Slow bass pulse, deep braams, distant textures, and restrained synth hits. Angst and tension builds with sparse intense hits. Oppressive sci-fi cinematic trailer score."}]},{category:"image-video",label:"Image & Video",assets:[{type:"image",name:"Tactical Approach",model:"Nano Banana Pro",prompt:"A police tactical squad approaching in formation through a dark urban environment. SWAT-style gear, helmets, tactical vests. Flashlight beams cutting through smoke and haze. Wet asphalt reflecting red and blue emergency lights. Cinematic, tense, high contrast.",thumbnailUrl:$("police-squad","scene1.jpg")},{type:"video",name:"Stack Formation",model:"Kling O1",prompt:"Police tactical team stacking up against a wall in tight formation, preparing to breach. Handheld camera following from behind. Dark corridor, flashlight beams, tense communication through hand signals. Very slow, deliberate movement.",thumbnailUrl:$("police-squad","scene2.jpg")},{type:"video",name:"Entry Breach",model:"Kling O1",prompt:"The squad breaches through a door in a coordinated entry. Flashbangs illuminate the scene, smoke fills the air. Fast, decisive movement as officers fan out. Dramatic lighting, high intensity, cinematic action.",thumbnailUrl:$("police-squad","scene3.jpg")}]}]},{id:"tibetan-monk",previewUrl:$("tibetan-monk","preview.mp4"),previewType:"video",posterUrl:$("tibetan-monk","poster.jpg"),aspectRatio:.6,createdWith:"Image & Video, Music",assetGroups:[{category:"music",label:"Music",assets:[{type:"music",name:"Himalayan Sunrise",prompt:"Music from generation"}]},{category:"image-video",label:"Image & Video",assets:[{type:"video",name:"Monastery Drone Descent",model:"Kling 3.0",prompt:"Cinematic drone shot descending slowly from high above a remote Tibetan monastery perched on a mountain ridge at sunrise. A solitary small monk in a deep crimson robe seated cross-legged in the stone courtyard, visible far below. Vast mist-covered Himalayan landscape stretching to the horizon.",thumbnailUrl:$("tibetan-monk","scene1.jpg")},{type:"image",name:"Monk Portrait",model:"Nano Banana 2",prompt:"An extreme close-up portrait of a young Tibetan monk boy meditating at sunrise. Approximately 10 years old with natural Tibetan features, smooth skin, slightly rounded-sm cheeks. Deep crimson robe, eyes closed, face completely still and at peace. Soft sunrise light illuminating his face. A small colorful butterfly sits on his nose with wings spread.",thumbnailUrl:$("tibetan-monk","scene2.jpg")},{type:"video",name:"Butterfly Circle",model:"Kling 3.0",prompt:"Slow continuous dolly in — a young Tibetan monk boy sits cross-legged in deep meditation in an ancient stone monastery courtyard. Dozens of butterflies of various species and colors drift in natural flight around him. The boy sits perfectly still, the calm center of everything. Sunrise light, peaceful atmosphere.",thumbnailUrl:$("tibetan-monk","scene3.jpg")}]}]},{id:"viking-fjord",previewUrl:$("viking-fjord","preview.mp4"),previewType:"video",posterUrl:$("viking-fjord","poster.jpg"),aspectRatio:1.6,createdWith:"Image & Video, Voices, Music",assetGroups:[{category:"voices",label:"Voices",assets:[{type:"voice",name:"British Football Announcer",voiceId:"gU0LNdkMOQCOrPrwtbee",prompt:"British Football Announcer narration for viking fjord scene"}]},{category:"music",label:"Music",assets:[{type:"music",name:"Viking Voyage Score",prompt:"Epic Nordic cinematic score for a Viking longship sailing through dramatic fjords. Low rumbling drums, deep brass horns, sweeping strings. Choral voices singing in Old Norse style. Building from quiet tension to majestic grandeur. Vast, ancient, powerful."}]},{category:"image-video",label:"Image & Video",assets:[{type:"image",name:"Viking Ship in Fjord",model:"Nano Banana Pro",prompt:"A Viking longship sailing through a dramatic Norwegian fjord. Towering cliffs on both sides, mist rolling down the mountainsides. The ship’s dragon prow cuts through dark fjord water. Crew of Viking warriors rowing in unison, shields lining the gunwales. Moody overcast sky, cinematic scale.",thumbnailUrl:$("viking-fjord","scene1.jpg")},{type:"video",name:"Rowing Through Fjord",model:"Kling O1",prompt:"Aerial tracking shot following the Viking longship as it rows through the narrow fjord. Oars rhythmically plunging and pulling through dark water. Steep mountain walls on both sides, waterfalls cascading down. Dramatic light breaking through clouds. Slow, powerful, majestic.",thumbnailUrl:$("viking-fjord","scene2.jpg")},{type:"video",name:"Dramatic Landscape",model:"Kling O1",prompt:"Wide cinematic shot of the Viking ship approaching the end of the fjord. Massive snow-capped mountains rising on all sides. Storm clouds gathering, golden light breaking through a gap in the clouds. The ship small against the vast ancient landscape. Epic, atmospheric, awe-inspiring.",thumbnailUrl:$("viking-fjord","scene3.jpg")}]}]},{id:"the-ocean",previewUrl:$("the-ocean","preview.mp4"),previewType:"video",posterUrl:$("the-ocean","poster.jpg"),aspectRatio:.75,createdWith:"Image & Video, Music",assetGroups:[{category:"music",label:"Music",assets:[{type:"music",name:"Ocean Documentary",prompt:"a serene, calm, beautiful song with single note piano for an underwater like nature documentary from a tranquil and ethereal atmosphere. national geographic with blue whales."}]},{category:"image-video",label:"Image & Video",assets:[{type:"video",name:"Underwater Dance",model:"Kling 3.0",prompt:"Freedivers swimming peacefully with manta rays and a hammerhead shark in open tropical ocean. Slow, graceful underwater movement. Sunlight filtering through the surface creating god rays. BBC Blue Planet cinematography style, serene and beautiful.",thumbnailUrl:$("the-ocean","scene1.jpg")},{type:"image",name:"Freediver and Whale",model:"Nano Banana Pro",prompt:"Photorealistic underwater shot of a female freediver and a blue whale gazing at each other, about 20 meters apart. Deep open ocean, nothing else around. Beautiful, serene, calm connection between human and whale. Light rays penetrating from the surface above. National Geographic quality.",thumbnailUrl:$("the-ocean","scene2.jpg")},{type:"video",name:"Whale Connection",model:"Kling 3.0",prompt:"Muffled underwater ambience, deep oceanic hum, distant low-frequency blue whale song. The blue whale glides slowly forward toward the freediver. As the whale draws close, the diver extends one hand and places fingertips gently on the whale’s snout. The moment of contact is still and weightless. Tranquil, ethereal.",thumbnailUrl:$("the-ocean","scene3.jpg")}]}]},{id:"fpv-drone-norway",previewUrl:$("fpv-drone-norway","preview.mp4"),previewType:"video",posterUrl:$("fpv-drone-norway","poster.jpg"),aspectRatio:16/9,createdWith:"Image & Video, Music",assetGroups:[{category:"music",label:"Music",assets:[{type:"music",name:"FPV Drone Track",prompt:"cool epic exciting track for fpv drone flying in norwegian fjords. a bit viking inspired sounds mixed with a cool electronic style. not too heavy, not like metal. some natural sounds mixed with some electronic"}]},{category:"image-video",label:"Image & Video",assets:[{type:"video",name:"Ridgeline Dive",model:"Kling O3",prompt:"High-speed FPV drone racing along a snow-covered Norwegian fjord ridgeline, then pitching forward aggressively as it tips over the cliff edge into a steep dive toward the dark fjord water below. Motion blur-sm across snow and exposed rock. Bright winter daylight, crisp blue sky, massive snow-capped peaks flanking both sides.",thumbnailUrl:$("fpv-drone-norway","scene1.jpg")},{type:"image",name:"Fjord Flyover",model:"Nano Banana 2",prompt:"Wide FPV drone shot in high speed flying down Norwegian fjords during a sunny winter day. Sweeping view of snow-covered mountains, deep navy fjord water winding between the peaks. Crisp clear air, distant mountain ranges fading to the horizon. FPV motion blur-sm and tilt. Exhilarating, vast, cinematic.",thumbnailUrl:$("fpv-drone-norway","scene2.jpg")},{type:"video",name:"Village Chase",model:"Kling O3",prompt:"Aggressive FPV drone chase at maximum speed over calm fjord water toward a colorful Norwegian fishing village. The camera constantly banking and rolling with sharp corrections, horizon tilting hard left then snapping right. Both drones weave and carve through the air in rapid succession.",thumbnailUrl:$("fpv-drone-norway","scene3.jpg")}]}]},{id:"rapper",previewUrl:$("rapper","preview.mp4"),previewType:"video",posterUrl:$("rapper","poster.jpg"),aspectRatio:9/14,createdWith:"Image & Video",assetGroups:[{category:"image-video",label:"Image & Video",assets:[{type:"image",name:"Cadillac Portrait",model:"Nano Banana Pro",prompt:"Slender pale-skinned Latino man, late 20s, chaotic pink hair with hot pink ends fading to near-black roots. Sharp angular features, thin pencil moustache. Leaning against the driver’s side door of a deep purple 1970s Cadillac convertible on a sun-drenched inner city street. Late 1990s consumer DV camera with fisheye lens. Heavy grain, authentic texture.",thumbnailUrl:$("rapper","scene1.jpg")},{type:"video",name:"Bro Hug",model:"Kling 3.0",prompt:"Handheld camera pushes toward the rapper leaning against the purple Cadillac. A friend enters frame from the right moving fast — the rapper spots him, face breaking into a genuine wide grin. Both men collide into a big full embrace, laughing. Harsh midday sun, heavy DV grain, authentic late 1990s texture.",thumbnailUrl:$("rapper","scene2.jpg")}]}]},{id:"komodo-bear",previewUrl:$("komodo-bear","preview.mp4"),previewType:"video",posterUrl:$("komodo-bear","poster.jpg"),aspectRatio:16/11,createdWith:"Image & Video, Music, Sound Effects",assetGroups:[{category:"music",label:"Music",assets:[{type:"music",name:"Nature Suspense",prompt:"subtle, dramatic BBC nature background track. predator approaching prey. suspense."}]},{category:"sfx",label:"Sound Effects",assets:[{type:"sfx",name:"Komodo Bear Growl",prompt:"a grizzly bear with a hint of monster and dragon sounds in his voice, growling subtly and breathing heavily."}]},{category:"image-video",label:"Image & Video",assets:[{type:"image",name:"Creature Character Sheet",model:"Nano Banana Pro",prompt:"Hyper-realistic Komodo Dragon and Grizzly Bear biological hybrid. Grizzly mass and musculature covered in overlapping keeled charcoal-grey scales with bronze undertones. Elongated bear head with serrated teeth, thick yellowish venomous saliva. Amber-gold vertical-slit reptilian eyes. BBC Earth wildlife photography standard.",thumbnailUrl:$("komodo-bear","scene1.jpg")},{type:"image",name:"Stalking Pose",model:"Nano Banana Pro",prompt:"The Komodo Bear in a low predatory stalking stance moving through volcanic badlands. Body low and wide, belly nearly scraping volcanic rock. Amber-gold eyes locked on off-camera prey. Massive jaws open, thick venom dripping. 18-inch forked tongue flicking. BBC Earth wildlife photography, cinematic tension.",thumbnailUrl:$("komodo-bear","scene2.jpg")},{type:"video",name:"Predator Advance",model:"Kling 3.0",prompt:"The massive Komodo Bear moves in slow, deliberate stalking approach. Body low to ground, careful measured steps forward. Classic Komodo alternating gait but slow and controlled, each footfall silent and calculated. Thick muscular tail dragging smoothly behind. BBC nature documentary cinematography, building tension.",thumbnailUrl:$("komodo-bear","scene3.jpg")}]}]},{id:"dog-hike",previewUrl:$("dog-hike","preview.mp4"),previewType:"video",posterUrl:$("dog-hike","poster.jpg"),aspectRatio:2,createdWith:"Image & Video, Voices, Music",assetGroups:[{category:"voices",label:"Voices",assets:[{type:"voice",name:"Bonnie Makenzie",voiceId:"",prompt:"[happy] He is my best friend. He’s with me wherever I go. [thoughtful] Rescuing a dog in need was the best decision of my life. I saved him so he could save me."}]},{category:"music",label:"Music",assets:[{type:"music",name:"Hiking Folk Song",prompt:"a happy acoustic folk song that is laid back, like a background track for a hiking video with a dog in the sun in the mountains with simple guitar chords and light percussion."}]},{category:"image-video",label:"Image & Video",assets:[{type:"image",name:"Waterfall Embrace",model:"Nano Banana Pro",prompt:"A young woman with auburn-red curly hair holds a Siberian Husky upright against her chest in a mountain plunge pool. She wears a deep red swimsuit and laughs openly, head tilted toward the dog. A tall cascading waterfall behind them, crystal-clear water, mossy rocks. Warm golden light, joyful and genuine. Photorealistic.",thumbnailUrl:$("dog-hike","scene1.jpg")},{type:"video",name:"Swimming Together",model:"Kling O3",prompt:"Handheld shot of the woman and husky swimming together in a Highland mountain pool. The dog paddles alongside her, both moving toward the waterfall. Clear water, rocks visible below. Natural, relaxed, real-time speed. Light camera shake adds authenticity.",thumbnailUrl:$("dog-hike","scene2.jpg")},{type:"video",name:"Swimming to Waterfall",model:"Kling 3.0",prompt:"Wide shot from behind as the woman and her husky swim together toward a tall cascading waterfall in a Highland gorge. Clear green water, rocky walls on both sides. The dog’s head above water, woman swimming beside. Peaceful, beautiful, warm summer light.",thumbnailUrl:$("dog-hike","scene3.jpg")}]}]},{id:"roman-ship",previewUrl:$("roman-ship","preview.mp4"),previewType:"video",posterUrl:$("roman-ship","poster.jpg"),aspectRatio:1.6,createdWith:"Image & Video, Music",assetGroups:[{category:"music",label:"Music",assets:[{type:"music",name:"Roman Empire Score",prompt:"inspiring and powerful background song for a film sequence with a roman warship that is on its way to sail the sea with the captain looking strong and ready. vocals should only be epic choir and orchestral sounds that matches the Roman Empire era"}]},{category:"image-video",label:"Image & Video",assets:[{type:"video",name:"Underwater Hull",model:"Kling O3",prompt:"Dramatic underwater view looking upward at a Roman warship “Fortuna.” Dark weathered timber hull with rows of oars cutting through bright turquoise Mediterranean water. Each oar trailing streams of white air bubbles. Sunlight refracting through the surface above. Cinematic, powerful, ancient.",thumbnailUrl:$("roman-ship","scene1.jpg")},{type:"image",name:"Ship Departing Athens",model:"Nano Banana 2",prompt:"A cinematic 45-degree aerial view of a massive SPQR-flagged Roman warship sailing out of harbor during a sunny day in Athens, Greece. The Acropolis and harbor visible behind the ship. Rows of soldiers and oarsmen aboard. Taken with ARRI film camera, 8K resolution, photorealistic.",thumbnailUrl:$("roman-ship","scene2.jpg")},{type:"video",name:"Centurion on Deck",model:"Kling O3",prompt:"Slow orbit around a Roman centurion standing at the ship’s railing. Red-plumed helmet, polished lorica segmentata armor, crimson cloak. The harbor and hilltop Acropolis drift in the background bokeh. His eyes fixed on the horizon with a stern unwavering gaze. Cinematic 50mm 1.2 shallow depth of field.",thumbnailUrl:$("roman-ship","scene3.jpg")}]}]},{id:"transformer",previewUrl:$("transformer","preview.mp4"),previewType:"video",posterUrl:$("transformer","poster.jpg"),aspectRatio:16/9,createdWith:"Image & Video",assetGroups:[{category:"image-video",label:"Image & Video",assets:[{type:"image",name:"Cyberpunk Motorcycle",model:"Nano Banana Pro",prompt:"A futuristic battle-worn motorcycle parked on dark rocky ground at night. Matte black carbon fiber body with aggressive low silhouette. Glowing teal/cyan LED wheel rings and headlights cutting through dense blue-teal fog. Magenta accent light at the rear exhaust. Twisted dead trees in the deep background. Hyper-realistic, moody, atmospheric.",thumbnailUrl:$("transformer","scene1.jpg")},{type:"video",name:"Transformation Sequence",model:"Kling 3.0",prompt:"The matte black futuristic motorcycle begins a slow, deliberate mechanical transformation on a dark rocky wasteland at night. Panels split and hinge outward, wheels fold up to become shoulders, the frame unfolds upward into a hulking bipedal combat mech. Dense teal fog, cyan glow illuminating the transformation. Hyper-realistic metal mechanics, 8K resolution.",thumbnailUrl: