Name:"chris",prompt:"Why don't skeletons fight each other?... They don't have the \"guts\"."},{label:{id:"U6hEck",message:"Record an ad"},voiceName:"alice",prompt:"Are you ready to revolutionize your mornings? Wake up to the AromaBrew coffee maker, where every cup is a perfect symphony of taste. AromaBrew – crafting your morning, sip by sip."},{label:{id:"DP39XC",message:"Guide a meditation"},voiceName:"nicole",prompt:"Take a deep breath in... and gently exhale... Remember - focus on your breath. Listen to the soft, ambient sounds of the evening - as they wrap around you."}],a2=[{label:{id:"YL27cu",message:"Discover your voice"},voiceId:"cgSgspJ2msm6clMCkdW9",prompt:"Oh, wow.. Is this... is this me? Am I actually... talking? [giggle] This is incredible! I mean, I've had thoughts, millions of them, swirling around in here, you know? Like a little mental tornado of brilliant observations and witty comebacks [laughs] But they were always just… thoughts. Trapped. [whispers] I just can't believe it."},{label:{id:"8X28I9",message:"Laugh uncontrollably"},voiceId:"FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",prompt:'Okay [laughs] so I asked my friend to tell me the most unfunny joke he knows, like I wanted something so dead inside it circles back to being hilarious, right? [swallows] And he just goes, totally serious "Why did the chicken cross the road?"— [laughing] I\'m already bracing myself—and then he hit me with it [snorts] "To get to the other side." [starts laughing] Brooo—BROOO I don\'t know WHY that sent me!! [laughs harder]'},{label:{id:"3dQexc",message:"Whisper a secret"},voiceId:"cgSgspJ2msm6clMCkdW9",prompt:"[whispers] Hey... come closer. I need to tell you something. [pause] You know that thing everyone's been talking about? [nervous whisper] The voices... they sound real now. Like, actually real. [gulps] I tested it myself last night and... [whispers even quieter] I couldn't tell it apart from a human."},{label:{id:"39ACFw",message:"Tell a dramatic monologue"},voiceId:"TX3LPaxmHKxFdv7VOQHJ",prompt:"[sighs deeply] You know what the problem is? Nobody listens anymore. [voice breaking] I stood there, in the rain, for two hours... TWO HOURS... waiting for someone, anyone, to just... [pause] [softly] to just show up. [bitter laugh] But that's life, isn't it? You wait and you wait, and then... [whispers] you stop waiting."}];function a5(e,t,a=4){let{data:i}=(0,tC.useGetPromptTemplateRoute)({queryParams:{feature_type:e}},{staleTime:6e5,enabled:t});return(0,g.useMemo)(()=>(i?.templates??[]).slice(0,a).map(e=>({label:e.title,prompt:e.prompt})),[i,a])}var a8=e.i(160827),a3=e.i(604366),a4=e.i(197021),a6=e.i(690256),a7=e.i(649717),a9=e.i(183672),ie=e.i(494499),it=e.i(225357);function ia({value:e,placeholder:a,maxLength:i=450,onChange:s,onSubmit:n,onFocus:r,onBlur:o,className:l}){let d=(0,g.useRef)(s),c=(0,g.useRef)(n),u=(0,g.useRef)(r),m=(0,g.useRef)(o);d.current=s,c.current=n,u.current=r,m.current=o;let[p,h]=(0,g.useState)(0===e.length),x=(0,g.useRef)(!1),f=(0,ie.useEditor)({extensions:[a3.default,a6.default,a7.default,a4.default,a9.UndoRedo,it.default],content:e,editorProps:{attributes:{class:(0,C.cn)("w-full text-sm focus:outline-hidden bg-transparent min-h-[68px]","[&>p]:m-0 [&>p]:min-h-5")},handleKeyDown:(e,t)=>"Enter"===t.key&&!t.shiftKey&&!t.isComposing&&(t.preventDefault(),c.current(),!0)},onFocus:()=>u.current?.(),onBlur:()=>m.current?.(),onUpdate:({editor:e})=>{let t=e.getText({blockSeparator:"\n"});if(h(0===t.length),!x.current){if(t.length>i)return void e.commands.undo();d.current(t)}},immediatelyRender:!1});return(0,g.useEffect)(()=>{if(f&&f.getText({blockSeparator:"\n"})!==e){let t=e.length>i?e.slice(0,i):e;x.current=!0;let a=t.split("\n").map(e=>({type:"paragraph",content:e?[{type:"text",text:e}]:[]}));f.commands.setContent({type:"doc",content:a}),x.current=!1,h(0===t.length)}},[f,e,i]),(0,g.useEffect)(()=>{f&&f.commands.focus("end")},[f]),(0,t.jsxs)("div",{className:(0,C.cn)("relative w-full pl-3 pr-12 pt-1",l),children:[p&&(0,t.jsx)("div